---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="tiers" id="levels">
  <div class="tiers-inner">
    <div class="tiers-hdr">
      <p class="sec-label">Membership Levels</p>
      <h2 class="sec-title">FIND YOUR CIRCLE.</h2>
      <p class="sec-desc" style="max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 2rem">
        Whether you are a business building a legacy or an individual answering the call, there is a
        place for you in the AV Circle.
      </p>
      <div class="tier-toggle">
        <button class="tbtn active" onclick="showPanel('corp', this)">
          Corporate and Business</button
        ><button class="tbtn" onclick="showPanel('indiv', this)">Individual Supporters</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tier-panel active" id="panel-corp">
      <div class="tiers-grid">
        <div class="tier-card">
          <div class="tier-name">AV Circle Pillar</div>
          <div class="tier-price">$250<span> – $499/month</span></div>
          <p class="tier-sub-price">$3,000 – $5,999/year</p>
          <p class="tier-desc">
            The foundation everything we do is built on. Pillar members are the reason Alabama
            veterans wake up to real support every day. Whether you commit to $250 or $499 a month,
            your business is a cornerstone of this community — and we’ll make sure Alabama knows it.
          </p>
          <ul class="tier-perks">
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Logo on AV Circle sponsor wall</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >Official Proud Supporter badge and brand package</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Social media spotlight (quarterly)</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Tax-deductible contribution letter</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Annual impact report with your name</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Recognition at all AV events</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="#"
            class="tier-btn"
            onclick="
                openContact(
                  'avcircle@alabamaveteran.org',
                  'Join the AV Circle',
                  'AV Circle Inquiry from',
                );
                return false;
              "
            >Become a Pillar</a
          >
        </div>
        <div class="tier-card feat">
          <div class="feat-badge">Most Popular</div>
          <div class="tier-name">Champions League</div>
          <div class="tier-price">$500<span> – $999/month</span></div>
          <p class="tier-sub-price">$6,000 – $11,999/year</p>
          <p class="tier-desc">
            Alabama veterans know who showed up. Champions are the businesses at the front of every
            formation — your brand becomes part of the fabric of everything AV does, month after
            month.
          </p>
          <ul class="tier-perks">
            <li><span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">All Pillar benefits, plus:</span></li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Featured on live sponsor leaderboard</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >Prominent logo on all event materials</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Monthly social media feature post</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >Named recognition at Warrior Retreats</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >CEO/owner photo opportunity at events</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >Custom Champion Proud Supporter badge</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >Priority access to AV event sponsorship opportunities</span
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="#"
            class="tier-btn"
            onclick="
                openContact(
                  'avcircle@alabamaveteran.org',
                  'Join the AV Circle',
                  'AV Circle Inquiry from',
                );
                return false;
              "
            >Join the League</a
          >
        </div>
        <div class="tier-card">
          <div class="tier-name">Titan Society</div>
          <div class="tier-price">$1,000<span>+/month</span></div>
          <p class="tier-sub-price">
            $12,000+/year · Major gifts and legacy giving available — contact us directly
          </p>
          <p class="tier-desc">
            For organizations making a bold, lasting commitment to Alabama veterans. Titans don’t
            just support the mission — they help define it. When AV events open for title
            sponsorship, Titans get the first call.
          </p>
          <ul class="tier-perks">
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">All Champions League benefits, plus:</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >First right of refusal on all AV event title sponsorships</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Premier homepage hero logo placement</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Press release and media announcement</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >Private annual briefing with AV leadership</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Custom employee engagement package</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Exclusive Titan Society plaque</span>
            </li>
            <li><span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">VIP tables at annual gala</span></li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="#"
            class="tier-btn"
            onclick="
                openContact(
                  'avcircle@alabamaveteran.org',
                  'Join the AV Circle',
                  'AV Circle Inquiry from',
                );
                return false;
              "
            >Rise as a Titan</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tier-panel" id="panel-indiv">
      <div class="tiers-grid">
        <div class="tier-card">
          <div class="tier-name">Circle Friend</div>
          <div class="tier-price">Any<span> amount</span></div>
          <p class="tier-desc">
            A one-time gift in any amount. Every dollar makes an immediate, direct impact for an
            Alabama veteran.
          </p>
          <ul class="tier-perks">
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Instant tax-deductible receipt</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">AV Circle Friend digital certificate</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >Impact update showing where your gift went</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">AV Circle community newsletter</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="https://my.onecause.com/fundraiser/organizations/069c5aa7-32be-4377-be03-b101310beee7/fundraisers/fundraiser:fd94be2b-b4ba-4e2a-b112-1ae8d3c376ee"
            class="tier-btn"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Give a One-Time Gift</a
          >
        </div>
        <div class="tier-card feat">
          <div class="feat-badge">Most Popular</div>
          <div class="tier-name">Circle Sustainer</div>
          <div class="tier-price">$25.00<span>/month</span></div>
          <p class="tier-desc">
            Reliable monthly support that lets Alabama Veteran plan ahead and serve more veterans,
            month after month. You can start for as little as $10 a month, though $25 is where most
            members make the biggest impact.
          </p>
          <ul class="tier-perks">
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">All Circle Friend benefits, plus:</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Monthly impact story to your inbox</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >Sustainer digital badge for social media</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Exclusive invitations to AV events</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >Sustainer-only quarterly briefing from AV leadership</span
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="https://my.onecause.com/fundraiser/organizations/069c5aa7-32be-4377-be03-b101310beee7/fundraisers/fundraiser:fd94be2b-b4ba-4e2a-b112-1ae8d3c376ee"
            class="tier-btn"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Become a Sustainer</a
          >
        </div>
        <div class="tier-card">
          <div class="tier-name">Circle Connector</div>
          <div class="tier-price">Free<span> to join</span></div>
          <p class="tier-desc">
            Become a fundraiser for Alabama Veteran. Connectors rally their friends, family, and
            network to give, turning one membership into many and carrying the mission farther than
            a single gift ever could.
          </p>
          <ul class="tier-perks">
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">All Sustainer benefits, plus:</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >Personal referral link to track your reach</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx">Connector-exclusive merchandise</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >Named recognition at AV community events (top Connectors)</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="pck">✓</span><span class="ptx"
                >Invitation to the annual Connector dinner (top Connectors)</span
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="https://my.onecause.com/fundraiser/organizations/069c5aa7-32be-4377-be03-b101310beee7/fundraisers/fundraiser:fd94be2b-b4ba-4e2a-b112-1ae8d3c376ee"
            class="tier-btn"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Become a Connector</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="major-gifts-note">
    <p>
      💬 Interested in a major gift, event sponsorship, or legacy giving?
      <a
        href="#"
        onclick="
            openContact(
              'avcircle@alabamaveteran.org',
              'Major Gifts & Legacy Giving',
              'AV Circle Major Gift / Legacy Inquiry from',
            );
            return false;
          "
        >Contact us directly</a
      >
      — we’d love to have that conversation.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
